    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_paper_was_written_at_a_moment_when_3-2026-07-09T05:35:17.328105+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T05:35:17.328105+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__Technical/Legal_Documentation_|_Temp__0.1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_paper_was_written_at_a_moment_when_3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "The paper was written at a moment when 3G hadn't fully rolled out, the iPhone was months away from launch, and \"app\" wasn't yet a common word. Its predictions — that cell phones would become 1-for-1 classroom devices, that mobile networks would reach remote regions, that GPS would become cheap enough to put in every student's pocket — all came true. The products the paper called for did not."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_originstorypage.the_paper_was_written_at_a_moment_when_3-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "A papel foi escrito em um momento em que a rede 3G ainda não havia se consolidado, o iPhone estava meses antes do lançamento e 'app' ainda não era uma palavra comum. Suas previsões - de que os celulares se tornariam dispositivos 1 para 1 das salas de aula, de que as redes móveis alcançariam regiões remotas e de que o GPS ficaria barato o suficiente para caber no bolso de cada aluno - todas se concretizaram. Os produtos que o papel previa não foram produzidos.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_paper_was_written_at_a_moment_when_3-2026-07-09T05:35:17.328105+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_paper_was_written_at_a_moment_when_3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.if_students_follow_their_curiosity_throu-2026-07-09T05:35:17.328105+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T05:35:17.328105+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__Technical/Legal_Documentation_|_Temp__0.1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.if_students_follow_their_curiosity_throu",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "If students follow their curiosity through real places, learning about arches, barrels, and celestial navigation because they're standing near a cathedral or a harbour, how do you assess what they've learned in a way that satisfies curriculum requirements? How do you produce the spreadsheet of numbers the principal wants while also honouring the complexity of what the student actually understood?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_originstorypage.if_students_follow_their_curiosity_throu-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Se os alunos seguem sua curiosidade por lugares reais, aprendendo sobre arcos, barris e navegação celeste porque estão perto de uma catedral ou um porto, como você avalia o que eles aprenderam de uma forma que satisfaça os requisitos do currículo? Como você produz a planilha de números que o diretor quer enquanto também honra a complexidade do que o aluno realmente entendeu?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.if_students_follow_their_curiosity_throu-2026-07-09T05:35:17.328105+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.if_students_follow_their_curiosity_throu"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_document_left_that_question_open_the-2026-07-09T05:35:41.443451+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T05:35:41.443451+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__Technical/Legal_Documentation_|_Temp__0.1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_document_left_that_question_open_the",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "The document left that question open. The school system didn't solve it either. For nearly two decades, \"outdoor learning\" remained either a vague aspiration or a logistical nightmare — teachers with clipboards, activities that produced no artifact, experiences that disappeared the moment students came back inside."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_originstorypage.the_document_left_that_question_open_the-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "A documento deixou essa questão em aberto. O sistema escolar também não resolveu o problema. Por quase duas décadas, 'aprendizagem ao ar livre' permaneceu seja uma aspiração vaga ou um pesadelo logístico — professores com pranchetas, atividades que não produziam nenhumartifacto, experiências que desapareciam no momento em que os alunos voltavam para dentro.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_document_left_that_question_open_the-2026-07-09T05:35:41.443451+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_document_left_that_question_open_the"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_first_part_was_solved_by_smartphones-2026-07-09T05:35:41.443451+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T05:35:41.443451+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__Technical/Legal_Documentation_|_Temp__0.1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_first_part_was_solved_by_smartphones",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "The first part was solved by smartphones. Photo, audio, GPS coordinates, timestamps — a student at a creek bank can capture more evidence in ten minutes than a field trip clipboard could hold in a day. What remained was the second part: structured inquiry that didn't just document experience but deepened it."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_originstorypage.the_first_part_was_solved_by_smartphones-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "A primeira parte foi resolvida pelos smartphones. Foto, áudio, coordenadas GPS, carimbos de data e hora - um estudante à beira de um riacho pode capturar mais provas em dez minutos do que uma prancheta de viagem poderia conter em um dia. O que restou foi a segunda parte: inquirição estruturada que não apenas documentava a experiência, mas aprofundava-a.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_first_part_was_solved_by_smartphones-2026-07-09T05:35:41.443451+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_first_part_was_solved_by_smartphones"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.thats_where_peri_comes_in_peri_is_peripa-2026-07-09T05:35:41.443451+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T05:35:41.443451+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__Technical/Legal_Documentation_|_Temp__0.1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.thats_where_peri_comes_in_peri_is_peripa",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "That's where Peri comes in. Peri is Peripateticware's AI guide — named, like the software, after the Aristotelian method. Peri doesn't answer questions. It asks them. It follows the five-phase inquiry sequence — Engage, Observe, Analyse, Explain, Apply — that Aristotle used in the Lyceum and that cognitive science has since validated as a path to genuine understanding, not just retention. Peri takes a student's observation and asks the next right question. When the student gets it right, Peri tests the implication. When the student is vague, Peri asks for evidence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_originstorypage.thats_where_peri_comes_in_peri_is_peripa-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "É aí que o Peri entra em cena. O Peri é o guia de IA do Peripateticware — nomeado, como o software, após o método aristotélico. O Peri não responde às perguntas. Ele faz perguntas. Ele segue a sequência de inquirição em cinco fases — Engajar, Observar, Analisar, Explicar, Aplicar — que Aristóteles usava na Liceu e que a ciência cognitiva validou como um caminho para uma compreensão genuína, não apenas retenção. O Peri toma a observação de um aluno e faz a próxima pergunta certa. Quando o aluno acerta, o Peri testa a implicação. Quando o aluno é vago, o Peri pede por evidências.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.thats_where_peri_comes_in_peri_is_peripa-2026-07-09T05:35:41.443451+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.thats_where_peri_comes_in_peri_is_peripa"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_result_is_an_artifact_a_field_journa-2026-07-09T05:35:41.443451+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T05:35:41.443451+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__Technical/Legal_Documentation_|_Temp__0.1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_result_is_an_artifact_a_field_journa",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "The result is an artifact: a field journal entry with captures, extended analysis, and a record of the inquiry itself. Teachers can see not just what a student concluded but how they got there. Rubrics aligned to Bloom's taxonomy and standards frameworks — CCSS, NGSS, TEKS, or your own — make the assessment legible to any curriculum coordinator. The spreadsheet and the real learning finally occupy the same document."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_originstorypage.the_result_is_an_artifact_a_field_journa-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "O resultado é um artefato: uma entrada de diário de campo com capturas, análise estendida e um registro da própria inquirição. Professores podem ver não apenas o que um aluno concluiu, mas como eles chegaram lá. Rubricas alinhadas à taxonomia de Bloom e quadros de padrões — CCSS, NGSS, TEKS ou os seus próprios — tornam a avaliação legível para qualquer coordenador curricular. A planilha e o aprendizado real finalmente ocupam o mesmo documento.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_result_is_an_artifact_a_field_journa-2026-07-09T05:35:41.443451+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_result_is_an_artifact_a_field_journa"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_2007_paper_described_a_choose_your_o-2026-07-09T05:35:41.443451+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T05:35:41.443451+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__Technical/Legal_Documentation_|_Temp__0.1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_2007_paper_described_a_choose_your_o",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "The 2007 paper described a \"choose your own adventure\" model of learning — one where students follow tangents, pursue what interests them, and encounter core curriculum concepts through the side doors of genuine curiosity rather than the front door of instruction. The paper acknowledged this was \"somewhat chaotic\" and that it would require new kinds of instructional design, new assessment tools, and teachers willing to trade some control for authentic engagement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_originstorypage.the_2007_paper_described_a_choose_your_o-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "A publicação de 2007 descreveu um modelo de aprendizado 'escolha sua própria aventura' — em que os alunos seguem tangentes, perseguem o que os interessa e encontram conceitos curriculares fundamentais através das portas laterais da curiosidade genuína, em vez da porta da instrução. O artigo reconheceu que isso era 'algum tanto caótico' e que exigiria novos tipos de projeto didático, novas ferramentas de avaliação e professores dispostos a abrir mão de algum controle em troca de um engajamento autêntico.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_2007_paper_described_a_choose_your_o-2026-07-09T05:35:41.443451+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_2007_paper_described_a_choose_your_o"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.peripateticware_doesnt_fully_solve_the_c-2026-07-09T05:36:05.554120+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T05:36:05.554120+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__Technical/Legal_Documentation_|_Temp__0.1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.peripateticware_doesnt_fully_solve_the_c",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Peripateticware doesn\\'t fully solve the chaos — that tension is real and probably permanent. What it does is give teachers enough structure to stay sane (designed activities, learning targets, completion phases, teacher approval workflows) while giving students enough freedom to actually go somewhere (GPS-triggered content, student-proposed activities, self-directed field notes, peer projects)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_originstorypage.peripateticware_doesnt_fully_solve_the_c-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Peripateticware não resolve completamente a confusão — essa tensão é real e provavelmente permanente. O que faz é dar aos professores suficiente estrutura para ficarem sãos (atividades projetadas, objetivos de aprendizagem, fases de conclusão, fluxos de trabalho de aprovação do professor) enquanto dá aos alunos suficiente liberdade para realmente ir a algum lugar (conteúdo acionado por GPS, atividades propostas pelos alunos, anotações de campo autodirigidas, projetos entre pares).",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.peripateticware_doesnt_fully_solve_the_c-2026-07-09T05:36:05.554120+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.peripateticware_doesnt_fully_solve_the_c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_reverse_scavenger_hunt_where_student-2026-07-09T05:36:05.554120+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T05:36:05.554120+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__Technical/Legal_Documentation_|_Temp__0.1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_reverse_scavenger_hunt_where_student",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "The reverse scavenger hunt — where students propose an activity based on something they found — is the closest thing in the platform to that 2007 vision. A student finds a peculiar rock formation. They propose it as an activity. The teacher approves it. Other students go look. Questions emerge that no curriculum document anticipated. Learning moves."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_originstorypage.the_reverse_scavenger_hunt_where_student-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "A caça ao tesouro reversa - onde os alunos propõem uma atividade com base em algo que encontraram - é o mais próximo que temos dessa visão de 2007. Um aluno encontra uma formação rochosa peculiar. Eles propõem como uma atividade. O professor aprova. Outros alunos vão procurar. Perguntas surgem que nenhum documento curricular previa. Aprendizado acontece.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_reverse_scavenger_hunt_where_student-2026-07-09T05:36:05.554120+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_reverse_scavenger_hunt_where_student"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_short_answer_is_that_most_of_the_ena-2026-07-09T05:36:05.554120+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T05:36:05.554120+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__Technical/Legal_Documentation_|_Temp__0.1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_short_answer_is_that_most_of_the_ena",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "The short answer is that most of the enabling technology wasn\\'t ready in 2007. GPS in every pocket came first (2010–2015). Then high-quality mobile cameras. Then cloud APIs cheap enough for schools. Then local AI models (Ollama, llama.cpp) that can run on a teacher\\'s home server without a $10,000/month inference bill. The 2007 paper was right about the destination; it couldn\\'t have known how long the road would be."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_originstorypage.the_short_answer_is_that_most_of_the_ena-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "A resposta curta é que grande parte da tecnologia habilitante ainda não estava pronta em 2007. O GPS em todos os bolsos veio primeiro (2010-2015). Depois, câmeras móveis de alta qualidade. Depois, APIs de nuvem baratas o suficiente para escolas. Depois, modelos de IA locais (Ollama, llama.cpp) que podem ser executados no servidor doméstico de um professor sem uma conta de $10.000/mês.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_short_answer_is_that_most_of_the_ena-2026-07-09T05:36:05.554120+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_short_answer_is_that_most_of_the_ena"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_longer_answer_is_that_educational_te-2026-07-09T05:36:05.554120+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T05:36:05.554120+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__Technical/Legal_Documentation_|_Temp__0.1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_longer_answer_is_that_educational_te",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "The longer answer is that educational technology spent those years solving the wrong problem. EdTech iterated on the classroom — better LMS, better video, better quiz tools. It made the existing model more efficient. Peripateticware doesn\\'t try to make the classroom more efficient. It tries to replace the classroom, at least occasionally, with the world."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_originstorypage.the_longer_answer_is_that_educational_te-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Resumindo, a tecnologia educacional passou aqueles anos resolvendo o problema errado. A EdTech aperfeiçoou a sala de aula — melhores LMS, melhores vídeos, melhores ferramentas de quiz. Ela tornou o modelo existente mais eficiente. O Peripateticware não tenta tornar a sala de aula mais eficiente. Ele tenta substituir a sala de aula, pelo menos ocasionalmente, pelo mundo.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_longer_answer_is_that_educational_te-2026-07-09T05:36:05.554120+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_longer_answer_is_that_educational_te"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.thats_a_harder_sell_schools_are_riskaver-2026-07-09T05:36:05.554120+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T05:36:05.554120+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__Technical/Legal_Documentation_|_Temp__0.1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.thats_a_harder_sell_schools_are_riskaver",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "That\\'s a harder sell. Schools are risk-averse. Outdoor learning has a liability optic. \"The world is your classroom\" sounds like a marketing line until you\\'ve watched a ten-year-old explain sediment transport to a crow-shaped AI guide while standing in a creek bed, and then read the field journal entry they wrote that afternoon, and understood that they understood."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_originstorypage.thats_a_harder_sell_schools_are_riskaver-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "A escola é mais cautelosa. O aprendizado ao ar livre tem uma perspectiva de responsabilidade. 'O mundo é sua sala de aula' parece uma frase de marketing até você ver uma criança de dez anos explicando o transporte de sedimento para um guia AI em forma de corvo enquanto está na cama do rio, e depois ler a entrada do diário de campo que eles escreveram à tarde, e entender que eles entenderam.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.thats_a_harder_sell_schools_are_riskaver-2026-07-09T05:36:05.554120+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.thats_a_harder_sell_schools_are_riskaver"
      }
    },
